    },
    "%@ ~ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A row that displays the start and end time of daylight saving time, along with the duration of that time. The first argument is the formatted start time. The second argument is the formatted end time. The third argument is the duration of daylight saving time, formatted as a single decimal number with one decimal place.",
